body:
My Ph.D. looked at how AI can support learning, especially collaborative learning in higher education: collaborative annotation, AI tutors built on mastery learning, generative AI agents for group work, and what large language models mean for syllabi and assessment.
As a Research Fellow at Tor Vergata, working under the scientific supervision of Prof. Antonella Poce (Experimental Pedagogy), I'm now:
- researching educational models for well-being and inclusion through cultural and museum heritage;
- investigating generative AI, immersive technologies and collaborative environments for heritage and museum education;
- designing and evaluating digital social prescribing approaches.
